# Branding shown in Vendor Onboarding emails. Both are optional - if left
# unset, COMPANY_NAME defaults to "SRIA INFOTECH PRIVATE LTD" and the header
# falls back to a text-only company name (no broken image icon) instead of a
# logo. COMPANY_LOGO_URL must be a full https:// link to a hosted image -
# email clients cannot load local/relative file paths.
# COMPANY_NAME=SRIA INFOTECH PRIVATE LTD
# COMPANY_LOGO_URL=https://your-public-domain.com/logo.png